option.WEATHER_WIND_BIAS                   = Смещение по ветрености
option.WEATHER_WIND_BIAS.comment = Controls windiness bias.
option.WEATHER_TEMPERATURE_VARIATION_SPEED = Скорость изменения температуры
option.WEATHER_TEMPERATURE_VARIATION_SPEED.comment = Controls temperature variation speed.
option.WEATHER_HUMIDITY_VARIATION_SPEED    = Скорость изменения влажности
